    "title": "Fulton Bank Mobile",
    "description": "Enjoy a seamless mobile experience designed exclusively for Android phones, tablets and Wear OS.  You'll have instant access to your Fulton Bank accounts.\r\n\r\n- Log in securely with the same username and password \r\n\r\n- Enjoy easy access with Fingerprint ID on supported devices with OS 9 or higher.\r\n\r\n- Check balances on your Fulton Bank accounts, including checking, savings, and more.\r\n\r\n- Deposit checks conveniently using Mobile Deposit.\r\n\r\n- Locate Fulton Bank branches.\r\n\r\n-With our Wear OS app, you can quickly and conveniently check your balance on your favorite wear device.",
